  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LAFIYA - Procurement of Family Planning Commodities by UNFPA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme procures contraceptive commodities for Nigeria to enhance family planning commodity security in the public health system.  The programme plays a catalytic role in enhancing access to modern contraception through the public sector in the 36 states and the FCT through consistent availability of a wide range of contraceptive methods, procured at highly favourable terms through UNFPA&#x2019;s Procurement Service Branch (PSB) in Copenhagen.</narrative>
  </description>
